# The guard suite reads App.jsx as TEXT, and several assertions match on a
# literal newline. With core.autocrlf=true a checkout rewrites every line to
# CRLF and those regexes stop matching correct code -- guard 29 has now failed
# this way twice, once from a text-mode write and once from a merge checkout.
# Pinning the working tree to LF fixes it at the source, for every clone and
# every machine, instead of teaching forty guards about carriage returns.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
